  lines:
  - english: Every letter you carry was once part of someone's memory.
    vietnamese: "M\u1ED7i m\u1EA3nh ch\u1EEF c\u1EADu mang theo t\u1EEBng l\xE0 m\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA7n k\xFD \u1EE9c c\u1EE7a ai \u0111\xF3."
  - english: If the creatures carry forgotten words, what disappears when they fall?
    vietnamese: "N\u1EBFu nh\u1EEFng sinh v\u1EADt \u1EA5y mang c\xE1c t\u1EEB b\u1ECB
      qu\xEAn, \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC s\u1EBD m\u1EA5t \u0111i khi ch\xFAng g\u1EE5c
      xu\u1ED1ng?"
